      "title": "Getting Started",
      "navTitle": "Getting Started",
      "updatedAt": "2026-11-11",
      "slug": "readme",
      "file": "readme.md",
      "section": "Quickstart",
      "path": "/projects/ionic-theme-ios26/docs/readme",
      "html": "<p>A CSS/JS theme library that applies iOS26 design system to Ionic applications.</p>\n<p>DEMO is here: <a href=\"https://ionic-theme-ios26.rdlabo.dev/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">https://ionic-theme-ios26.rdlabo.dev/</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"installation\"><a class=\"header-anchor-link\" href=\"#installation\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></a> Installation</h2>\n<div class=\"code-block-container\"><pre class=\"shiki github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#151e2c;color:#e1e4e8\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">npm</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\"> install</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\"> @rdlabo/ionic-theme-ios26</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span></code></pre></div><p>After Ionic's base CSS, add the system-dark stylesheet to your global stylesheet.</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-container\"><pre class=\"shiki github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#151e2c;color:#e1e4e8\"><code style=\"color:#e1e4e8\"><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#F97583\">@import</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\"> '@rdlabo/ionic-theme-ios26/styles/system.css'</span>;</span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span></code></pre></div><p>Spread <code>ios26ThemeConfig</code> into your existing Ionic initializer's options. The<br>\nconfiguration supplies iOS mode and theme animations.</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-container\"><pre class=\"shiki github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#151e2c;color:#e1e4e8\"><code style=\"color:#e1e4e8\"><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#F97583\">import</span> { ios26ThemeConfig } <span style=\"color:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\"> '@rdlabo/ionic-theme-ios26'</span>;</span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\"> ionicConfig</span><span style=\"color:#F97583\"> =</span> {</span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#F97583\">  ...</span>ios26ThemeConfig,</span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#a0aab5\">  // animated: false,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\">};</span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span></code></pre></div><p>Follow <a href=\"/projects/ionic-theme-ios26/docs/setup\">Set up the theme</a> for Angular, React, and Vue examples,<br>\ndark-mode selection, and a preview. Use <a href=\"/projects/ionic-theme-ios26/docs/configuration\">Configuration</a><br>\nfor individual CSS and animation exports, custom options, and iOS 26 with MD3.<br>\nExisting applications can adopt the wrappers using <a href=\"/projects/ionic-theme-ios26/docs/migration\">Migration</a>.</p>\n<h2 id=\"documentation\"><a class=\"header-anchor-link\" href=\"#documentation\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></a> Documentation</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/projects/ionic-theme-ios26/docs/using-ion-item-group\">Using ion-item-group</a> — required markup for inset lists.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/projects/ionic-theme-ios26/docs/special-markup\">Special markup and classes</a> — opt-in markup and utility classes used by the theme.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/projects/ionic-theme-ios26/docs/eslint\">ESLint</a> — check list structure with ESLint rules.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/projects/ionic-theme-ios26/docs/features\">Features</a> — CSS variables, Liquid Glass, selective imports, and dark mode.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/projects/ionic-theme-ios26/docs/experimental-animation\">Experimental Animation</a> — tab bar and searchable effects.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/projects/ionic-theme-ios26/docs/ios-18\">iOS 18</a> — load the theme only on iOS 26.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/projects/ionic-theme-ios26/docs/migration\">Migration</a> — optional wrapper adoption and version-specific upgrade steps.</li>\n</ul>\n",
